<h2 style="margin-top:0;color:#111827;">
  🎉 Payment Successful & Order Confirmed
</h2>

<p>
  Dear <strong><%= customerName %></strong>,
</p>

<p>
  Thank you for choosing NSSON Auto Parts.
</p>

<p>
  We are pleased to inform you that your payment has been successfully received and your order has been confirmed.
</p>

<div
  style="
    background:#ecfdf5;
    border-left:4px solid #10b981;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:8px;
    margin:25px 0;
  "
>
  <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;">
    <strong>Order Number:</strong>
    #<%= orderNumber %>
  </p>

  <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;">
    <strong>Payment Status:</strong>
    Successful
  </p>

  <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;">
    <strong>Amount Paid:</strong>
    ₹<%= totalAmount %>
  </p>

  <p style="margin:0;">
    <strong>Payment Method:</strong>
    <%= paymentMethod %>
  </p>
</div>

<p>
  Our team has started processing your order and it will be packed and dispatched shortly.
</p>

<p>
  Once your order has been shipped, we will send you another email containing tracking information and delivery updates.
</p>

<div
  style="
    background:#f9fafb;
    border:1px solid #e5e7eb;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:8px;
    margin-top:25px;
  "
>
  <strong>What Happens Next?</strong>

  <ul style="padding-left:20px;">
    <li>Order Processing</li>
    <li>Quality Inspection</li>
    <li>Packaging & Dispatch</li>
    <li>Shipment Tracking Shared</li>
    <li>Delivery To Your Address</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<p style="margin-top:25px;">
  We appreciate your trust in NSSON Auto Parts and look forward to serving you again.
</p>

<p>
  Thank you for shopping with us.
</p>

<p>
  Warm Regards,<br />
  <strong>NSSON Auto Parts Team</strong>
</p>
